{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underlod </strong>is an fast-paced arcade RTS. Build out your troops, and pilot them to victory. Inspired by classic RTS gameplay, along with elements from Diablo, Hearthstone, Dota, and auto-battlers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your troops attack automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Move your units with the mouse to kite and dodge incoming attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose troops during the run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy powerful items to charge up your build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 60+ passive items, with synergies to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 different troops, each with a unique attack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 difficulties plus endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30+ Steam achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3130860?t=1752236882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130860/c6b8c6d03eadab0338b40e7fd8c8c28bb389acb6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752236882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130860/d8c0f0d923999bfc161dec13f127026ccec7018b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752236882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130860/d8c0f0d923999bfc161dec13f127026ccec7018b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752236882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"M